   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>Given the characteristics equation of a system s<sup>5</sup> + 2s<sup>4</sup> + 24s<sup>3 </sup>+ 48s<sup>2</sup> &ndash; 25s &ndash; 50 = 0. The number of roots in the right half of s-plane is</p>",
